      },
      "transliterations": {
        "devanagari": "*कड्ले इद्दाग हल्लिल्ल, हल्लिद्दाग कड़्लिल्ल।",
        "latin": "*kadle iddaga hallilla, halliddaga kadlilla."
      },
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "usage-C-q3",
      "section": "usage-activity-C",
      "text": "*ಕುಟ್ಟಾಕ ಬರದೋಳು ಕೇರಿ ಕೇರಿ ನೋಡಿದಳಂತ.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "*The one who doesn't know how to pound, looked after winnowing.",
        "hi": "*जिसे कूटना नहीं आता, वह फटकने का दिखावा करती है।"
